00:01:59.500 --> 00:02:02.620
Colors power de katsuyaku shiyou!

00:02:08.580 --> 00:02:10.250
Mitsuboshi Jump!

00:02:30.620 --> 00:02:32.290
Snow!

00:02:39.750 --> 00:02:41.160
What is all this?

00:02:41.160 --> 00:02:44.000
What happened? There's so much snow!

00:02:44.000 --> 00:02:46.290
I feel like we'll encounter some stronger enemies!

00:02:46.830 --> 00:02:48.790
Oh! It's a snowman!

00:02:51.120 --> 00:02:52.910
Ya-hoo!

00:02:55.580 --> 00:02:58.290
What should we do? What should we do first?

00:02:58.410 --> 00:03:00.120
I wanna build a snow fort!

00:03:00.120 --> 00:03:01.540
Snow fort? Good idea!

00:03:01.540 --> 00:03:03.040
Let's go look at the fountain!

00:03:03.040 --> 00:03:04.250
Another good idea!

00:03:04.950 --> 00:03:06.000
Fountain?

00:03:06.160 --> 00:03:07.160
Why?

00:03:07.160 --> 00:03:09.410
If it's frozen over, maybe we can skate on it!

00:03:09.410 --> 00:03:10.790
I wanna skate!

00:03:10.790 --> 00:03:13.370
I like it! Nice idea!

00:03:13.950 --> 00:03:15.250
Off to the fountain!

00:03:15.250 --> 00:03:16.000
Yeah!

00:03:16.790 --> 00:03:18.200
We're gonna skate!

00:03:18.200 --> 00:03:19.450
They're excited.

00:03:19.750 --> 00:03:20.950
Slide on the ice!

00:03:20.950 --> 00:03:22.830
Slip and slide.

00:03:26.790 --> 00:03:28.250
Ow!

00:03:28.250 --> 00:03:30.410
We slid before we even got to the fountain!

00:03:30.410 --> 00:03:32.870
Not much point in going there now.

00:03:32.870 --> 00:03:35.160
Nope! That'd be snowing too far!

00:03:35.160 --> 00:03:39.000
I wonder where all this snow came from.

00:03:40.370 --> 00:03:41.290
The sky.

00:03:41.700 --> 00:03:43.200
The sky?

00:03:43.200 --> 00:03:45.250
It doesn't look like there's anything up there.

00:03:45.250 --> 00:03:47.410
It's a good thing snow is white.

00:03:47.410 --> 00:03:49.830
If it were brown, people wouldn't know it from poop.

00:03:49.830 --> 00:03:51.330
And they might step in some.

00:03:54.120 --> 00:03:56.620
It's poop!

00:03:57.830 --> 00:03:59.120
This is bad.

00:03:59.450 --> 00:04:03.910
The park is now full of snow-covered poopy traps.

00:04:04.160 --> 00:04:05.500
What kind of trap is that?

00:04:05.500 --> 00:04:07.700
I just had a great idea!

00:04:07.950 --> 00:04:11.830
For today, our Colors job

00:04:07.950 --> 00:04:11.830
can be finding all the poopy traps!

00:04:11.830 --> 00:04:15.830
What? I don't want to go out of my way

00:04:11.830 --> 00:04:15.830
to look for poo.

00:04:15.950 --> 00:04:17.620
I'm with Leader.

00:04:19.040 --> 00:04:20.290
I see.

00:04:21.160 --> 00:04:22.250
I know!

00:04:22.250 --> 00:04:24.250
I have an even better idea!

00:04:25.040 --> 00:04:28.000
I knew you'd show up, you snot-nosed brats.

00:04:28.000 --> 00:04:31.830
But you underestimate me. Who do you think I am?

00:04:31.830 --> 00:04:34.080
I grew up in Aomori, the land of snow!

00:04:34.370 --> 00:04:37.290
I've never lost a snowball fight in my life!

00:04:37.660 --> 00:04:41.000
Or what? Do you have some sort of a plan?

00:04:41.160 --> 00:04:42.830
I seriously doubt it!

00:04:44.750 --> 00:04:46.000
But we do have plan.

00:04:47.250 --> 00:04:49.660
One of these snowballs has poop in it.

00:04:55.950 --> 00:04:57.700
Running away, Saito?

00:04:57.700 --> 00:04:58.870
You coward!

00:04:58.870 --> 00:05:00.870
Yui-ball Attack!

00:05:00.870 --> 00:05:02.370
Get back out here, Saito!

00:05:02.370 --> 00:05:04.790
Spineless wimp! Tell Aomori you're sorry!

00:05:04.790 --> 00:05:06.910
Yui-ball Attack!

00:05:10.000 --> 00:05:12.370
Colors

00:05:12.580 --> 00:05:13.870
Huh?

00:05:13.870 --> 00:05:16.410
See? I told you I'm taller.

00:05:16.410 --> 00:05:18.370
You're not standing on your toes?

00:05:18.370 --> 00:05:20.040
I'm not, I promise!

00:05:20.040 --> 00:05:21.330
Hmm.

00:05:21.540 --> 00:05:24.660
You are standing on your toes, you liar!

00:05:24.660 --> 00:05:26.410
Of course I am!

00:05:26.410 --> 00:05:29.370
I never heard any rule that says

00:05:26.410 --> 00:05:29.370
you can't stand on your toes.

00:05:29.370 --> 00:05:31.120
There's no rule that says

00:05:29.370 --> 00:05:31.120
you can stand on your toes, either!

00:05:31.120 --> 00:05:32.540
What is it, Colonel Monochrome?

00:05:31.120 --> 00:05:32.540
There's no rule that says

00:05:31.120 --> 00:05:32.540
you can stand on your toes, either!

00:05:32.540 --> 00:05:33.870
Well, you can just stand on your toes, Yui!

00:05:33.870 --> 00:05:34.870
Did you steal something again?

00:05:33.870 --> 00:05:34.870
Well, you can just stand on your toes, Yui!

00:05:34.870 --> 00:05:35.830
Did you steal something again?

00:05:34.870 --> 00:05:35.830
Oh, good point.

00:05:35.830 --> 00:05:37.790
Wait, no! Ugh!

00:05:36.200 --> 00:05:38.750
Good

00:05:36.200 --> 00:05:38.750
Luck

00:05:37.790 --> 00:05:38.790
This is...!

00:05:37.790 --> 00:05:38.790
Wait, no! Ugh!

00:05:39.080 --> 00:05:40.450
Hey, Kotoha.

00:05:40.450 --> 00:05:42.790
I have a question about height contest rules.

00:05:42.790 --> 00:05:43.870
Never mind that.

00:05:43.870 --> 00:05:46.330
Your secret is out

00:05:43.870 --> 00:05:45.080
Look at this.

00:05:46.330 --> 00:05:47.750
Your secret is out

00:05:47.910 --> 00:05:49.580
"Your secret is out"?

00:05:49.910 --> 00:05:50.950
Standing on my toes?

00:05:50.950 --> 00:05:52.040
See?

00:05:52.040 --> 00:05:53.660
Of course not.

00:05:54.120 --> 00:05:55.330
This...

00:05:55.330 --> 00:05:58.410
may be our greatest crisis

00:05:55.330 --> 00:05:58.410
since the formation of Colors!

00:05:58.410 --> 00:06:01.330
What? Wh-what do you mean, Kotoha?

00:06:01.330 --> 00:06:05.450
From what I can tell, this is a prayer plaque

00:06:01.330 --> 00:06:05.450
from the temple on Shopping Street.

00:06:05.910 --> 00:06:11.580
Whoever wrote this used Colonel Monochrome

00:06:05.910 --> 00:06:11.580
to send us a message.

00:06:13.000 --> 00:06:15.040
And that message is...

00:06:18.950 --> 00:06:21.450
..."I've found your hideout."

00:06:22.370 --> 00:06:23.750
N-no!

00:06:24.040 --> 00:06:26.290
