00:06:26.870 --> 00:06:28.080
You look happy.

00:06:28.080 --> 00:06:29.620
Let's set some traps!

00:06:29.620 --> 00:06:30.910
A tiger pit!

00:06:31.200 --> 00:06:33.200
Let's put spikes at the bottom!

00:06:33.540 --> 00:06:34.370
