00:06:35.450 --> 00:06:37.870
First let's go to the temple with these plaques.

00:06:35.580 --> 00:06:40.160
Your secret is out

00:06:37.870 --> 00:06:40.200
We might find some kind of clue.

00:06:40.950 --> 00:06:44.750
Starting now, Colors will begin

00:06:40.950 --> 00:06:44.750
