00:06:47.580 --> 00:06:49.660
I like it! I love it!

00:06:49.660 --> 00:06:52.080
Shh! Not so loud!

00:06:52.080 --> 00:06:55.120
These are covert operations, so we have to be quiet!

00:06:55.290 --> 00:06:56.870
That's a good point.

00:06:56.870 --> 00:06:59.580
Okay. Starting covert operations.

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:03.080
We'll all make it to that temple together.

00:07:03.750 --> 00:07:05.200
Yeah!

00:07:13.330 --> 00:07:14.790
There's no one around.

00:07:14.790 --> 00:07:16.410
Yeah. The coast is clear.

00:07:16.750 --> 00:07:17.660
Okay!

00:07:18.330 --> 00:07:19.410
Let's do this!

00:07:19.410 --> 00:07:20.410
Go! Go! Go! Go! Go! Go! Go! Go!

00:07:20.410 --> 00:07:22.080
Don't shout!

00:07:20.410 --> 00:07:22.080
Go! Go! Go! Go! Go! Go! Go! Go!

00:07:22.080 --> 00:07:22.870
Go! Go! Go! Go! Go! Go! Go! Go!

00:07:25.080 --> 00:07:25.830
Okay.

00:07:25.830 --> 00:07:26.700
Okay.

00:07:26.700 --> 00:07:27.620
Okay.

00:07:45.120 --> 00:07:48.370
Yo, Leader! These are covert operations!

00:07:49.200 --> 00:07:52.700
I know! Don't be so loud!

00:07:53.410 --> 00:07:54.750
This is Yellow!

00:07:55.410 --> 00:07:58.000
Condition green! Over!

00:07:58.250 --> 00:07:59.370
This is Blue.

00:07:59.580 --> 00:08:02.000
I'm right here, so quit shouting. Over.

00:08:02.370 --> 00:08:04.370
Red, same situation.

00:08:04.370 --> 00:08:07.950
And hey, we didn't bring our walkie-talkies. Over.

00:08:08.830 --> 00:08:10.540
Listen, guys!

00:08:10.540 --> 00:08:13.160
We're about to pass by the police box.

00:08:13.540 --> 00:08:15.370
One guard out front: Saito.

00:08:15.500 --> 00:08:17.660
There is no way to avoid him.

00:08:18.500 --> 00:08:19.410
And so...

00:08:19.950 --> 00:08:21.950
I volunteer to act as decoy.

00:08:22.330 --> 00:08:23.410
But...

00:08:23.580 --> 00:08:25.410
But we promised!

00:08:25.410 --> 00:08:27.200
We promised we'd all...

00:08:28.540 --> 00:08:30.660
We'd all make it to the temple together!

00:08:31.580 --> 00:08:32.540
We did.

00:08:33.370 --> 00:08:34.870
So wait for me.

00:08:35.330 --> 00:08:37.330
On the other side of this road.

00:08:40.580 --> 00:08:41.080
Go! Go! Go! Go! Go! Go!

00:08:41.080 --> 00:08:42.540
Sat-chan!

00:08:41.080 --> 00:08:42.540
Go! Go! Go! Go! Go! Go!

00:08:42.540 --> 00:08:43.910
Go!

00:08:43.910 --> 00:08:45.200
What happened to "covert"?

00:08:45.500 --> 00:08:46.410
Saito!

00:08:46.790 --> 00:08:47.830
Look closely!

00:08:51.200 --> 00:08:52.410
Ooh la la!

00:09:00.410 --> 00:09:03.700
Your friends went that way. Now get lost.

00:09:18.790 --> 00:09:19.790
This way!

00:09:20.120 --> 00:09:23.160
Ouch! Huh? Where are you?

00:09:32.870 --> 00:09:33.500
Want 'em?

00:09:33.500 --> 00:09:34.200
Shh!

00:09:35.790 --> 00:09:37.200
On second thought, gimme!

00:09:38.660 --> 00:09:41.580
Yum

00:09:49.950 --> 00:09:52.040
We finally made it!

00:09:53.950 --> 00:09:56.200
The place with the plaques is just past here.

00:09:56.580 --> 00:09:57.500
Let's go!

00:10:02.540 --> 00:10:03.500
This is it!

00:10:08.410 --> 00:10:10.330
They all have wishes on them.

00:10:10.330 --> 00:10:12.040
Yeah, no clues.

00:10:13.500 --> 00:10:16.950
I was really hoping to hear Koto-chan say,

00:10:13.500 --> 00:10:16.950
"I've beat this game."

00:10:17.200 --> 00:10:20.910
Let's write a wish that we can solve this case!

00:10:21.200 --> 00:10:23.040
Looking for something?

00:10:24.200 --> 00:10:25.830
Uh, no! Not really!

00:10:25.830 --> 00:10:27.200
A prayer plaque, perhaps?

00:10:27.410 --> 00:10:29.580
Uh, um...

00:10:29.870 --> 00:10:32.000
Maybe a prayer plaque?

00:10:32.290 --> 00:10:34.290
But maybe not.

00:10:48.080 --> 00:10:50.540
Hm? Is something the matter?

00:11:01.000 --> 00:11:02.910
Your secret is out

